SPDX-License-Identifier: Zlib
SPDX-FileNotice: retrods local patch, not part of upstream libretro-cap32.

Guard retro_ui_draw_db() against a NULL surface.

retro_ui_draw_db() is called from retro_load_game() and computer_reset(), but
keyboard_surface is only set to point at real storage by retro_ui_init(). When
the loaded DSK is not in the core's hash database (game_configuration.is_clean is
false) it draws into that surface and crashes.

Applied with: patch -p1 < patches/libretro-cap32/0001-draw-db-null-guard.patch
